{"3904770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Semperfly: FPV Drone Ops", "steam_appid": 3904770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4983580], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/8cd7763bc0712bb8e6c3eb58266a3484.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/8cd7763bc0712bb8e6c3eb58266a3484.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/8cd7763bc0712bb8e6c3eb58266a3484.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue, Strike, Search, Race…</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on mission-based operations across the full spectrum. Run search-and-rescue over disaster zones, fly recon and mapping sweeps, inspect infrastructure, tear through time-trial race courses, then switch to the sharp end with precision strike runs. Civilian or combat, every mission is a different problem to solve, across varied maps, seasons, and conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/166847bf9776c1930c1169aa71c6b8b9.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/166847bf9776c1930c1169aa71c6b8b9.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/166847bf9776c1930c1169aa71c6b8b9.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Battlefield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own scenarios with the built-in level builder: place objectives, set conditions, and craft the missions you want to fly. And it doesn't stop at launch: full modding support for custom levels and drones is on the way, so the community can build new aircraft, new challenges, and new ways to fly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/d780d8572e15ef4afb26410cb98833e6.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/d780d8572e15ef4afb26410cb98833e6.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/d780d8572e15ef4afb26410cb98833e6.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it online and fly together, team up on operations or go head-to-head. Compete for the fastest times, the cleanest runs, and bragging rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/a2312eb4b131f691b20e6598684f0ba5.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/a2312eb4b131f691b20e6598684f0ba5.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/a2312eb4b131f691b20e6598684f0ba5.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Your Wings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through the ranks of Task Force Semperfly. Sharpen your skills, unlock new drones and loadouts, and climb from raw recruit to elite operator as the missions escalate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/9765fe5cfb48fa00c90dc11c0249cbbd.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/9765fe5cfb48fa00c90dc11c0249cbbd.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/9765fe5cfb48fa00c90dc11c0249cbbd.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semperfly is committed to supporting any controller out of the box - jump in with a gamepad or Steam Deck, or plug in your own radio controller for true stick-and-throttle flight that feels like the real thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OORAH!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/8cd7763bc0712bb8e6c3eb58266a3484.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/8cd7763bc0712bb8e6c3eb58266a3484.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/8cd7763bc0712bb8e6c3eb58266a3484.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue, Strike, Search, Race…</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on mission-based operations across the full spectrum. Run search-and-rescue over disaster zones, fly recon and mapping sweeps, inspect infrastructure, tear through time-trial race courses, then switch to the sharp end with precision strike runs. Civilian or combat, every mission is a different problem to solve, across varied maps, seasons, and conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/166847bf9776c1930c1169aa71c6b8b9.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/166847bf9776c1930c1169aa71c6b8b9.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/166847bf9776c1930c1169aa71c6b8b9.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Battlefield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own scenarios with the built-in level builder: place objectives, set conditions, and craft the missions you want to fly. And it doesn't stop at launch: full modding support for custom levels and drones is on the way, so the community can build new aircraft, new challenges, and new ways to fly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/d780d8572e15ef4afb26410cb98833e6.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/d780d8572e15ef4afb26410cb98833e6.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/d780d8572e15ef4afb26410cb98833e6.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it online and fly together, team up on operations or go head-to-head. Compete for the fastest times, the cleanest runs, and bragging rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/a2312eb4b131f691b20e6598684f0ba5.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/a2312eb4b131f691b20e6598684f0ba5.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/a2312eb4b131f691b20e6598684f0ba5.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Your Wings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through the ranks of Task Force Semperfly. Sharpen your skills, unlock new drones and loadouts, and climb from raw recruit to elite operator as the missions escalate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/9765fe5cfb48fa00c90dc11c0249cbbd.poster.avif?t=1787425804\" width=960 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/9765fe5cfb48fa00c90dc11c0249cbbd.webm?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904770/extras/9765fe5cfb48fa00c90dc11c0249cbbd.mp4?t=1787425804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semperfly is committed to supporting any controller out of the box - jump in with a gamepad or Steam Deck, or plug in your own radio controller for true stick-and-throttle flight that feels like the real thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OORAH!</strong></p>", "short_descripti